				"&l&aGeneral Factory User Guide"
				""
				"&lEfficient production machine: Put multiple input bins/buses/assemblies and turn on isolation, so that one machine can execute the recipes of multiple circuits or molds at the same time."
				""
				"How to use &l: Place the single-block machine&fcorresponding to the&bworking mode in the factory GUI (only one can be placed)."
				""
				"&cImportant condition: The machine level of the single block placed must accurately match the factory recipe voltage!"
				""
				"&6This machine supports dual warehouse boosting!"
				""
				"&aDue to the limitations of the single-block machine: when the quantity of AE distributed is too large, the single-block machine will stop working or connect circuits. Therefore, it is recommended to replace all single-block machines with general-purpose factories. Don’t think it is unnecessary. Single-block machines are far less efficient than general-purpose factories."
